  "ruleText": "Per 102.65 “Part-time employee” means an individual who works on a part-time basis.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.40); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.41); ss by #13667, eff 6-12-23 (formerly Per 102.45); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.56), eff 12-1-25",
